{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1523798-v20-rites-of-the-blood-and-willpower-rolls-for-paths-krainas","id":1523798,"title":"V20 Rites of the Blood and Willpower rolls for Paths / Krainas","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-10-07T17:33:51-07:00","id":1523798,"title":"V20 Rites of the Blood and Willpower rolls for Paths / Krainas","content":"Greetings,<br /> <br /> As per Rites of the Blood p.103<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Blood and the Will</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">The dice mechanics of Necromancy as<br /> depicted in V20 work somewhat differently<br /> than what is described here, but for the<br /> purposes of this book, Necromancy is just<br /> another form of blood magic and works<br /> mechanically just the same as all of the other<br /> paths, i.e. with <b>Willpower rolls instead of<br /> Attribute + Ability rolls for path powers<br /> and Intelligence + Occult rolls for all<br /> Necromancy rituals. Similarly, Sorcery paths<br /> such as Akhu and Koldunic Sorcery which<br /> previously used different dice pools will<br /> now also use Willpower rolls for all paths.</b></div> </div> </div> </div>Does that change the difficulty to be rolled to the Thaumaturgy / Koldunic Sorcery (difficulty equal to the power\u2019s level +3), or does it keep each roll as the same difficulty as it was changing only the stats rolled? For example Necromancy Paths each power had distinct difficulties.<br /> <br /> <br /> Another question, does the change of <b>The Principle of Blood</b> (Rites of the Blood p.131) mean that Koldunic Sorcery and Necromancy cost a blood point <i>instead </i>of their stated costs? Or it is in <i>addition</i>? Some power description mention spending Willpower to work (Rigor Mortis from The Grave\u2019s Decay) or multiple blood points (Dark Humors from Path of the Four Humors)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4967,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","user":"lbeaumanior","date":". 03-24-2024, 01:21 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-10-09T17:21:40-07:00","id":1523893,"title":"","content":"Regarding your first point, if your campaign is standardizing all the blood magic rolls to fit with Thaumaturgy, it seems only fair to do the same with difficulties.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3505-matt-the-bruins-fan","name":"Matt the Bruins fan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3505_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2401"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-11-16T15:19:36-08:00","id":1525543,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Matt the Bruins fan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1523798-v20-rites-of-the-blood-and-willpower-rolls-for-paths-krainas?p=1523893#post1523893\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Regarding your first point, if your campaign is standardizing all the blood magic rolls to fit with Thaumaturgy, it seems only fair to do the same with difficulties.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks, any ideas about the second point? The costs?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-11-16T21:57:09-08:00","id":1525556,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>lbeaumanior</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1523798-v20-rites-of-the-blood-and-willpower-rolls-for-paths-krainas?p=1525543#post1525543\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Thanks, any ideas about the second point? The costs?</div> </div> </div> </div>RAW, I don't think it changes. That said, Necromancy was harder to use than Thaumaturgy because willpower costs are harder to recover from and Attribute + Ability rolls are harder to optimise than Willpower. On the other side, low gen characters may reach pools of more than 10 dice with Attribute + Ability.<br /> If the intention is to even out the gaps between these forms of magic, and if the principle behind Necromancy is reframed to work through the Principle of Blood, then I guess one can just change the cost as well.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/16965-hermeticus","name":"Hermeticus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"431"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}